(4059059, 582550, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the Blue Angels. You have a very nice capture here. I like the composition and the configuration of the jets in formation. Certainly meets the challenge. The color on the jets seems a little off and we''ve lost some of the wing dtails that would make this image pop.</td>', 'Love the Blue Angels. You have a very nice capture here. I like the composition and the configuration of the jets in formation. Certainly meets the challenge. The color on the jets seems a little off and we''ve lost some of the wing dtails that would make this image pop.', '2007-09-05 01:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
