(4059077, 582291, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo of the brownies. Color and texture are fantastic! Good enough to eat. The background lets the image down a bit. And except for the shoehorn title, doesn''t seem to have much to do with the challenge theme. Still, I like the image and I''m giving it a pretty good score.</td>', 'Very nice photo of the brownies. Color and texture are fantastic! Good enough to eat. The background lets the image down a bit. And except for the shoehorn title, doesn''t seem to have much to do with the challenge theme. Still, I like the image and I''m giving it a pretty good score.', '2007-09-05 01:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4059091, 579975, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very good subject. Very dramatic illustration of power. It would be better IMO if the whites weren''t blown. It feels to me like you gave it too much mid-tone contrast, or a bit too much effect in Curves. Back off just a little bit and it would be better, I think.</td>', 'Very good subject. Very dramatic illustration of power. It would be better IMO if the whites weren''t blown. It feels to me like you gave it too much mid-tone contrast, or a bit too much effect in Curves. Back off just a little bit and it would be better, I think.', '2007-09-05 01:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
