(4060832, 581260, 52080, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much going on in this photo.  My eye keeps getting pulled into several areas at once and none of them grabs my attention.  The fire, the signs, the mirror on the nearby vehicle, the guys on the left.</td>', 'I think there is too much going on in this photo.  My eye keeps getting pulled into several areas at once and none of them grabs my attention.  The fire, the signs, the mirror on the nearby vehicle, the guys on the left.', '2007-09-05 10:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
