(4061392, 582297, 18614, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, nice lighting..a little off center..dont know if that is the effect you wanted. overall great shot</td>', 'beautiful shot, nice lighting..a little off center..dont know if that is the effect you wanted. overall great shot', '2007-09-05 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
