(4061462, 582032, 26001, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent concept. if it was not so dark and his face was not blurry you would have definitely fetched 10 from me. although i am bumping you up with a 7</td>', 'this is an excellent concept. if it was not so dark and his face was not blurry you would have definitely fetched 10 from me. although i am bumping you up with a 7', '2007-09-05 12:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
