(4064787, 581107, 74534, '<td valign="top">Conceptually interesting, but could have been better executed. It takes a while to figure out what''s going on, and the insertion point of the neon in the orange is not convincing. Could have used a backlight on the orange for more definition. Overall underexposed as well.</td>', 'Conceptually interesting, but could have been better executed. It takes a while to figure out what''s going on, and the insertion point of the neon in the orange is not convincing. Could have used a backlight on the orange for more definition. Overall underexposed as well.', '2007-09-06 10:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
