(4065471, 580659, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/> <br/>As for meeting the challenge... yes, sibling love can be very powerful, but I''m not entirely sure how this image portrays sibling love. Perhaps the boy is thinking of a sibling who is far off. As for technically... IMO, the border doesn''t work very well here. But the lighting is beautiful! Overall it''s a sweet shot that potrays meaning. :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :) As for meeting the challenge... yes, sibling love can be very powerful, but I''m not entirely sure how this image portrays sibling love. Perhaps the boy is thinking of a sibling who is far off. As for technically... IMO, the border doesn''t work very well here. But the lighting is beautiful! Overall it''s a sweet shot that potrays meaning. :)', '2007-09-06 14:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065473, 581816, 59335, '<td valign="top">"B" for effort, "F" for lighting.  It also looks like the lens has some fog over it or something making the image soft.</td>', '"B" for effort, "F" for lighting.  It also looks like the lens has some fog over it or something making the image soft.', '2007-09-06 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
