(4065480, 581739, 54778, '<td valign="top">The composition is very interesting.. my only issue is that instead of the red the body would have been nicer as orange or even blue..</td>', 'The composition is very interesting.. my only issue is that instead of the red the body would have been nicer as orange or even blue..', '2007-09-06 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065483, 581630, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m really not entirely sure what exactly this is. I''m guessing a sunset...It doesn''t potray a feeling of power for me. :( Because everything looks blurry, this image feels like the whole thing is completely out of focus. Maybe it''s not; I don''t know. Sunsets images can be hard to get focused! But I do really love the colors against the black. Keep trying! :)</td>', 'I''m really not entirely sure what exactly this is. I''m guessing a sunset...It doesn''t potray a feeling of power for me. :( Because everything looks blurry, this image feels like the whole thing is completely out of focus. Maybe it''s not; I don''t know. Sunsets images can be hard to get focused! But I do really love the colors against the black. Keep trying! :)', '2007-09-06 14:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065488, 582538, 63269, '<td valign="top">Technically everything is very nice with this photo, but it doesn''t have a lot of impact for me. I''m not really sure what to suggest might help...Perhaps adding more contrast and saturation might give a different, more interesting effect. Good try though! :)</td>', 'Technically everything is very nice with this photo, but it doesn''t have a lot of impact for me. I''m not really sure what to suggest might help...Perhaps adding more contrast and saturation might give a different, more interesting effect. Good try though! :)', '2007-09-06 14:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065494, 582074, 63269, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that this image portrays ''power'' well... but the inverted colors are really bizarre and itneresting looking though! Keep trying! :)</td>', 'I don''t feel that this image portrays ''power'' well... but the inverted colors are really bizarre and itneresting looking though! Keep trying! :)', '2007-09-06 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065497, 580661, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and splendid colors. Intersting border as well... Good shot.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and splendid colors. Intersting border as well... Good shot.', '2007-09-06 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065503, 582559, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very good idea! The shilouetted forms give lots of impact and a feel of power. I would suggest next time you take a shot like this, against the sun, try over-exposeing it just a little bit more, so that the sun is less distinct. It might possibly create a nicer effect... Good shot.</td>', 'Very good idea! The shilouetted forms give lots of impact and a feel of power. I would suggest next time you take a shot like this, against the sun, try over-exposeing it just a little bit more, so that the sun is less distinct. It might possibly create a nicer effect... Good shot.', '2007-09-06 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065512, 580556, 63269, '<td valign="top">The image does not seem to have much composition to it, giving everything a sort of cluttered feel. I can understand that getting composition to a subject like this would be very hard! Neat idea though, and beautiful colors! :)</td>', 'The image does not seem to have much composition to it, giving everything a sort of cluttered feel. I can understand that getting composition to a subject like this would be very hard! Neat idea though, and beautiful colors! :)', '2007-09-06 14:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065518, 580211, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture! It looks almost like it might be <i>slightly </i> out of focus, but I''m not sure. I would suggest adding some more contrast and saturation to this image, to give it more impact. Good try! :)</td>', 'Interesting picture! It looks almost like it might be slightly  out of focus, but I''m not sure. I would suggest adding some more contrast and saturation to this image, to give it more impact. Good try! :)', '2007-09-06 14:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065523, 580469, 63269, '<td valign="top">Technically speaking, this is a very nice image, perfectly focused, perfectly exposed, and with an interesting composition. However, it doesn''t have a lot of impact. Perhaps adding more contrast would help, and it might look really cool in black and white. Excellent shot though!</td>', 'Technically speaking, this is a very nice image, perfectly focused, perfectly exposed, and with an interesting composition. However, it doesn''t have a lot of impact. Perhaps adding more contrast would help, and it might look really cool in black and white. Excellent shot though!', '2007-09-06 14:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065526, 582149, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The diagonal composition is great, and the blurs very good. It almost looks like it might need some more contrast, or a little adjustment in levels to get some of the highlights to be more white.</td>', 'Nicely done! The diagonal composition is great, and the blurs very good. It almost looks like it might need some more contrast, or a little adjustment in levels to get some of the highlights to be more white.', '2007-09-06 14:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065529, 582032, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the sepia tones and the low-key lighting. The motion blur is excellent, and helps give a powerful atmosphere to the shot. Something doesn''t feel quite natural with the lighting however. I like the darkness, but nothing is white in the photo, giving the whole image a rather dreary, unpleasant look. Perhaps you could try some adjustments with the levels in photoshop, but that might ruin the nice low-key effect. Anyways, it''s a neat image - good work!</td>', 'I love the sepia tones and the low-key lighting. The motion blur is excellent, and helps give a powerful atmosphere to the shot. Something doesn''t feel quite natural with the lighting however. I like the darkness, but nothing is white in the photo, giving the whole image a rather dreary, unpleasant look. Perhaps you could try some adjustments with the levels in photoshop, but that might ruin the nice low-key effect. Anyways, it''s a neat image - good work!', '2007-09-06 14:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065530, 582316, 63269, '<td valign="top">This might have been more interesting with a different composition to it - less centered. But the textures are nicely focused and very interesting.</td>', 'This might have been more interesting with a different composition to it - less centered. But the textures are nicely focused and very interesting.', '2007-09-06 14:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065533, 581710, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very nice shallow DOF</td>', 'Very nice shallow DOF', '2007-09-06 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065535, 581140, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks like an awesome image, but much of the impact is ruined by the distraction of poor quality. If there were some way to get rid of the grainy-ness this would be splendid! I love the colors and the light!</td>', 'This looks like an awesome image, but much of the impact is ruined by the distraction of poor quality. If there were some way to get rid of the grainy-ness this would be splendid! I love the colors and the light!', '2007-09-06 14:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065540, 582290, 63269, '<td valign="top">POWERFUL lighting! And nice use of low-key. The background is a little distracting... but I''m just being picky. :) Superb image.</td>', 'POWERFUL lighting! And nice use of low-key. The background is a little distracting... but I''m just being picky. :) Superb image.', '2007-09-06 14:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065543, 582041, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry... I really don''t know what this is... and it doesn''t portray a feeling of power to me.</td>', 'I''m sorry... I really don''t know what this is... and it doesn''t portray a feeling of power to me.', '2007-09-06 14:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065547, 578958, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure how this meets the challenge...I would suggest tring to change the lighting. The skin tones are very gray and flat looking... but perhaps it was very difficult to get nice lighting where you were at. Good try though - the focus is good, and the composition fine!</td>', 'I''m not really sure how this meets the challenge...I would suggest tring to change the lighting. The skin tones are very gray and flat looking... but perhaps it was very difficult to get nice lighting where you were at. Good try though - the focus is good, and the composition fine!', '2007-09-06 14:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065566, 581531, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat image! I love the tones and textures, and the lighting, although very neat... feels almost unbalanced. The left side of the image immediately starts out being bright, and then fades into dark. If there had been anyway to make it go from a little bit of dark, to light, and then dark again, that might have looked nicer. But I apologize, I''m being <i>really </i>picky! :) This is an excellent shot, and perhaps there was no way for you to be able to do that.</td>', 'Neat image! I love the tones and textures, and the lighting, although very neat... feels almost unbalanced. The left side of the image immediately starts out being bright, and then fades into dark. If there had been anyway to make it go from a little bit of dark, to light, and then dark again, that might have looked nicer. But I apologize, I''m being really picky! :) This is an excellent shot, and perhaps there was no way for you to be able to do that.', '2007-09-06 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065595, 581404, 16850, '<td valign="top">Placing the emblem at the upper right third would have the leading line work into the photo instead of out of it.</td>', 'Placing the emblem at the upper right third would have the leading line work into the photo instead of out of it.', '2007-09-06 15:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
