(4065675, 579176, 63269, '<td valign="top">The high-contrast and low lighting do create a powerful effect, but otherwise, I''m not entirely sure if this really fits the challenge all that well... just my opinion. :) Very cool image though!</td>', 'The high-contrast and low lighting do create a powerful effect, but otherwise, I''m not entirely sure if this really fits the challenge all that well... just my opinion. :) Very cool image though!', '2007-09-06 15:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065679, 580683, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect - I like the way the silvery gray colors contrast so vibrantly with the glowing orange.</td>', 'Very interesting effect - I like the way the silvery gray colors contrast so vibrantly with the glowing orange.', '2007-09-06 15:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065685, 581522, 63269, '<td valign="top">Clever and well executed - the focus is perfect! It could perhaps use a little bit of a levels adjustment, to make the background whiter...just a thought. Good photo, and neat take on the challenge!</td>', 'Clever and well executed - the focus is perfect! It could perhaps use a little bit of a levels adjustment, to make the background whiter...just a thought. Good photo, and neat take on the challenge!', '2007-09-06 15:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065690, 579615, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very nice capturing of the sunrays!</td>', 'Very nice capturing of the sunrays!', '2007-09-06 15:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065724, 579636, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/>I know from experience how impossibly difficult it is to take a picture of a gun and get an interesting composition. Perhaps standing it on end, and shooting it from an angle would have made this shot much more interesting. Try experimenting with different angles. Also, the image has a sort of blue-ish cast...some adjustments with Selective color might help that out a bit if you wanted to fix it. And finally, the image is a little grainy. If it''s possible to set the ISO on your camera lower, that would help. Hope that''s all helpful! Keep trying! :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :)I know from experience how impossibly difficult it is to take a picture of a gun and get an interesting composition. Perhaps standing it on end, and shooting it from an angle would have made this shot much more interesting. Try experimenting with different angles. Also, the image has a sort of blue-ish cast...some adjustments with Selective color might help that out a bit if you wanted to fix it. And finally, the image is a little grainy. If it''s possible to set the ISO on your camera lower, that would help. Hope that''s all helpful! Keep trying! :)', '2007-09-06 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065735, 581866, 63269, '<td valign="top">Breath-takingly glorious! Fabulous scene and fabulous capture. I love the indigo blues of the sky and the way the dusting of stars sparkle out. Would not be surprised to see this in the top ten... good luck! :)</td>', 'Breath-takingly glorious! Fabulous scene and fabulous capture. I love the indigo blues of the sky and the way the dusting of stars sparkle out. Would not be surprised to see this in the top ten... good luck! :)', '2007-09-06 16:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065742, 580327, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, the lighting and the high-contrast is certainly powerful. Neat shot! I like the way the image is sort of layered from blue sky, to black shilouette, blue sky, to black shilouette. Good composition.</td>', 'Well, the lighting and the high-contrast is certainly powerful. Neat shot! I like the way the image is sort of layered from blue sky, to black shilouette, blue sky, to black shilouette. Good composition.', '2007-09-06 16:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065748, 582148, 63269, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it''s just my screen, but the right side of his face looks a little blown out. Other than that, this is fantastic! The tones and lighting are superb.</td>', 'Perhaps it''s just my screen, but the right side of his face looks a little blown out. Other than that, this is fantastic! The tones and lighting are superb.', '2007-09-06 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065755, 579427, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting - the contrast might be too high, making the image feel to busy. But otherwise very nice capture!</td>', 'Interesting - the contrast might be too high, making the image feel to busy. But otherwise very nice capture!', '2007-09-06 16:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065758, 582433, 63269, '<td valign="top">:) Neat idea! Good lighting and focus.</td>', ':) Neat idea! Good lighting and focus.', '2007-09-06 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
