(4065769, 582220, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure, but it almost looks slightly blurry - particularly the two black circular scales on the right. Neat idea though. Good lighting. :)</td>', 'I''m not sure, but it almost looks slightly blurry - particularly the two black circular scales on the right. Neat idea though. Good lighting. :)', '2007-09-06 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065774, 581707, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the bright and vibrant, <i>powerful</i> colors! Well done and clever idea!</td>', 'I love the bright and vibrant, powerful colors! Well done and clever idea!', '2007-09-06 16:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065788, 581563, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome image. I love all the deep black in the sky and the high contrast!</td>', 'Awesome image. I love all the deep black in the sky and the high contrast!', '2007-09-06 16:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065800, 581485, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat shot - and I love the colors. The grass is a lovely green, and the falls have a sort of pink color to them, which goes very nicely. However I would definitely suggest adding either more contrast or adjusting the levels in photoshop, to make the highlights more white.</td>', 'Neat shot - and I love the colors. The grass is a lovely green, and the falls have a sort of pink color to them, which goes very nicely. However I would definitely suggest adding either more contrast or adjusting the levels in photoshop, to make the highlights more white.', '2007-09-06 16:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065801, 580337, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2007-09-06 16:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065803, 580011, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.', '2007-09-06 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065810, 581869, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it! The variety of textures is splendid! The spikey texture of the waves against the ripling water, and then the smooth glassy reflections...Beautiful.</td>', 'I love it! The variety of textures is splendid! The spikey texture of the waves against the ripling water, and then the smooth glassy reflections...Beautiful.', '2007-09-06 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065819, 581521, 63269, '<td valign="top">On my screen at least, the ground has a rather unpleasant yellow-ish tint. Perhaps some adjustments with the selective color in photoshop would be able to correct that. Otherwise, interesting shot!</td>', 'On my screen at least, the ground has a rather unpleasant yellow-ish tint. Perhaps some adjustments with the selective color in photoshop would be able to correct that. Otherwise, interesting shot!', '2007-09-06 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
