(4065829, 581785, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well... I personally don''t think this image potrays power very well... but I love the way the sepia tones give the image an old fashioned feel. Neat shot!</td>', 'Well... I personally don''t think this image potrays power very well... but I love the way the sepia tones give the image an old fashioned feel. Neat shot!', '2007-09-06 16:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
