(4065850, 582077, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the way the smoke is blue by the trees! Neat shot.</td>', 'I love the way the smoke is blue by the trees! Neat shot.', '2007-09-06 16:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065860, 581632, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although the image doesn''t have very much interest or initial impact...(although I''m sure it would be very hard to photograph a wasp nest and get good composition!) I think it fits the challenge, and the exposure, focus, colors, and textures are very nice. Excellent try!</td>', 'Although the image doesn''t have very much interest or initial impact...(although I''m sure it would be very hard to photograph a wasp nest and get good composition!) I think it fits the challenge, and the exposure, focus, colors, and textures are very nice. Excellent try!', '2007-09-06 16:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
