(4065881, 582146, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat image! Personally I think I would have cropped a little more on the right of the image. Also, there is a blue-ish tint to everything that looks a little unnatural. But otherwise, this is an awesome photo. I like the sharpness of the focus on the subject against the black background. It creates a powerful effect.</td>', 'Neat image! Personally I think I would have cropped a little more on the right of the image. Also, there is a blue-ish tint to everything that looks a little unnatural. But otherwise, this is an awesome photo. I like the sharpness of the focus on the subject against the black background. It creates a powerful effect.', '2007-09-06 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065883, 582133, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! Good composition.</td>', 'Neat! Good composition.', '2007-09-06 16:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065917, 580716, 62164, '<td valign="top">the one of the left look a litte scary</td>', 'the one of the left look a litte scary', '2007-09-06 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065929, 582141, 62164, '<td valign="top">like how his back lit. mayby have the light in front a little hight but other than that nice</td>', 'like how his back lit. mayby have the light in front a little hight but other than that nice', '2007-09-06 16:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
