(4066156, 580683, 42181, '<td valign="top">Without wanting to use expletives, this is f**k**g superb.<br/>The vapor comming off the wings, the heat haze and the view up the engine nozzles just screams POWER!!!!<br/>Spot on colours, great focus and good composition. 10+</td>', 'Without wanting to use expletives, this is f**k**g superb.The vapor comming off the wings, the heat haze and the view up the engine nozzles just screams POWER!!!!Spot on colours, great focus and good composition. 10+', '2007-09-06 17:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
