(4066424, 581707, 51793, '<td valign="top">There is no doubt that this is a good image but I just don''t see what the little flowers have to do with power. You''re greens are a little blown out and your reflection is in the glass. You should back up some more on the next one.</td>', 'There is no doubt that this is a good image but I just don''t see what the little flowers have to do with power. You''re greens are a little blown out and your reflection is in the glass. You should back up some more on the next one.', '2007-09-06 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
