(4066553, 579491, 74534, '<td valign="top">Power over life and death... excellent challenge interpretation!!! Though by your title I''m not sure you had the same idea as me. Crop closer on the top and try a less noisy B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Power over life and death... excellent challenge interpretation!!! Though by your title I''m not sure you had the same idea as me. Crop closer on the top and try a less noisy B&W conversion.', '2007-09-06 20:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
