(4066561, 581202, 74534, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... hard one. Not sure "power" is what it makes me think of, but it does work. Very nice composition. Just a bit tilted. Too bad weather didn''t give a more interesting sky. Also a bit of noise and over-sharpening.</td>', 'Hmmm... hard one. Not sure "power" is what it makes me think of, but it does work. Very nice composition. Just a bit tilted. Too bad weather didn''t give a more interesting sky. Also a bit of noise and over-sharpening.', '2007-09-06 20:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066566, 581563, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very good challenge interpretation and composition. Of course, you chose a "powerful" B&amp;W conversion that either makes os brakes the photo... For me, it makes it.</td>', 'Very good challenge interpretation and composition. Of course, you chose a "powerful" B&W conversion that either makes os brakes the photo... For me, it makes it.', '2007-09-06 20:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066576, 582426, 74534, '<td valign="top">Your subject is not very interesting to me... Lighting seems flat as well.</td>', 'Your subject is not very interesting to me... Lighting seems flat as well.', '2007-09-06 20:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
