(4066758, 582019, 17513, '<td valign="top">well i hope the cow was ok...great shot</td>', 'well i hope the cow was ok...great shot', '2007-09-06 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066761, 581603, 17513, '<td valign="top">NICE!!!!</td>', 'NICE!!!!', '2007-09-06 21:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066765, 581928, 77724, '<td valign="top">Clever title, nice image, top of the Hancock?</td>', 'Clever title, nice image, top of the Hancock?', '2007-09-06 21:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066767, 581603, 63503, '<td valign="top">A good image of an obviously powerful engine, good technical elements, that is good focus, dof and exposure, I particularly like how you were able to capture the details of the black objects despite the obviously hard sunlight. Unfortunately the overall image lacks visual interest. I''ve been trying to think of a way to make the image more interesting and give a bit of a story, but can''t come up with any great ideas, perhaps a hand pourinp fluid into that black canister in the upper right (if that is what the canister is for) or a hand working on some part with a wrench or perhaps just opening the lid to that canister, something like that.</td>', 'A good image of an obviously powerful engine, good technical elements, that is good focus, dof and exposure, I particularly like how you were able to capture the details of the black objects despite the obviously hard sunlight. Unfortunately the overall image lacks visual interest. I''ve been trying to think of a way to make the image more interesting and give a bit of a story, but can''t come up with any great ideas, perhaps a hand pourinp fluid into that black canister in the upper right (if that is what the canister is for) or a hand working on some part with a wrench or perhaps just opening the lid to that canister, something like that.', '2007-09-06 21:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066768, 581866, 77724, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew how to do this.  Awsome.</td>', 'I wish I knew how to do this.  Awsome.', '2007-09-06 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066770, 579206, 17513, '<td valign="top">would have liked a little more light on her bump!! and just slightly on his face(only my opinion) other than that what a beautiful picture,i love it</td>', 'would have liked a little more light on her bump!! and just slightly on his face(only my opinion) other than that what a beautiful picture,i love it', '2007-09-06 21:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066771, 581678, 63503, '<td valign="top">Like your shallow dof here. Would have liked to see the girls a bit more to the left and farther from the distracting (and merging) palm to the right.</td>', 'Like your shallow dof here. Would have liked to see the girls a bit more to the left and farther from the distracting (and merging) palm to the right.', '2007-09-06 21:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066777, 581517, 77724, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W treatment.</td>', 'Nice B&W treatment.', '2007-09-06 21:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066785, 581129, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but less than ideal execution. IMO this is one where motion blur would have been nice to give the feeling of speed and power. Also, the ball is obviously overexposed.</td>', 'Nice idea but less than ideal execution. IMO this is one where motion blur would have been nice to give the feeling of speed and power. Also, the ball is obviously overexposed.', '2007-09-06 21:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066791, 579176, 63503, '<td valign="top">Junior is overexposed and with blown-out highlights.</td>', 'Junior is overexposed and with blown-out highlights.', '2007-09-06 21:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066799, 581514, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nothing appears to be in focus or correctly exposed here. Also, the red background has excessive noise, sorry.</td>', 'Nothing appears to be in focus or correctly exposed here. Also, the red background has excessive noise, sorry.', '2007-09-06 21:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066807, 582207, 63503, '<td valign="top">Colors appear distorded, probably due to over-processing.</td>', 'Colors appear distorded, probably due to over-processing.', '2007-09-06 21:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066816, 581136, 63503, '<td valign="top">Better picture than the one of the black Camaro, but you shouldn''t be doing this in the street ;-) . Of course, you could say you were just taking the picture and don''t even know the guy in the car.</td>', 'Better picture than the one of the black Camaro, but you shouldn''t be doing this in the street ;-) . Of course, you could say you were just taking the picture and don''t even know the guy in the car.', '2007-09-06 21:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066826, 582146, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and good story. IMO a bit too green and light a bit too harsh.</td>', 'Nice crop and good story. IMO a bit too green and light a bit too harsh.', '2007-09-06 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066840, 581563, 63503, '<td valign="top">Are you sure this is basic editing? there seems to be a lot of selective dodging and/or burning here. Personally, I think I would have liked it much more without the processing.</td>', 'Are you sure this is basic editing? there seems to be a lot of selective dodging and/or burning here. Personally, I think I would have liked it much more without the processing.', '2007-09-06 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066842, 582272, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great Image !!</td>', 'Great Image !!', '2007-09-06 21:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4066845, 581705, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the long exposure time here, I think it did add to the conveyance of power by the moving water (when ordinarily it does the opposite !!)</td>', 'Very nice, I like the long exposure time here, I think it did add to the conveyance of power by the moving water (when ordinarily it does the opposite !!)', '2007-09-06 21:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
