(4068245, 581563, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot. Enough that I want to give it a 10. But, your chosen title just kind of, well, frankly it ticks me off for some reason. I know we''re here to vote on photos, not titles. But think of it like this. If the Mona Lisa were named ''Sorta chubby lady smirking a weak smile while people for centuries wonder why'' - I don''t think it would be as popular a work of art as it is today.</td>', 'I like the photo a lot. Enough that I want to give it a 10. But, your chosen title just kind of, well, frankly it ticks me off for some reason. I know we''re here to vote on photos, not titles. But think of it like this. If the Mona Lisa were named ''Sorta chubby lady smirking a weak smile while people for centuries wonder why'' - I don''t think it would be as popular a work of art as it is today.', '2007-09-07 06:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
