(4069618, 582041, 208, '<td valign="top">I can''t for the life of me figure out what this is. I assume some sort of electrical discharge or other sci-fi type of thing. It just isn''t interesting enough as an abstract to warrant a good score.</td>', 'I can''t for the life of me figure out what this is. I assume some sort of electrical discharge or other sci-fi type of thing. It just isn''t interesting enough as an abstract to warrant a good score.', '2007-09-07 16:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069638, 581404, 208, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the details are missing to make it work for your concept: the hood ornament could use a good polish, the chrome needs a shine, the hood needs a wax, and the reflection should be a more obvious symbol of success (a mansion, for example). I do like the angles and the almost-centered subject.</td>', 'Good idea, but the details are missing to make it work for your concept: the hood ornament could use a good polish, the chrome needs a shine, the hood needs a wax, and the reflection should be a more obvious symbol of success (a mansion, for example). I do like the angles and the almost-centered subject.', '2007-09-07 16:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069646, 579491, 208, '<td valign="top">There can be only one!</td>', 'There can be only one!', '2007-09-07 16:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069664, 581678, 208, '<td valign="top">The whole picture seems drab somehow. The colors aren''t really muted, but there seems to be a light gray filter over the whole thing.</td>', 'The whole picture seems drab somehow. The colors aren''t really muted, but there seems to be a light gray filter over the whole thing.', '2007-09-07 16:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069676, 581707, 208, '<td valign="top">I hope you do a non-Basic version of this to get rid of your reflection in the glass. The idea is great, but some of the reflections are distracting.</td>', 'I hope you do a non-Basic version of this to get rid of your reflection in the glass. The idea is great, but some of the reflections are distracting.', '2007-09-07 16:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069727, 581707, 43774, '<td valign="top">Even though I can see your reflection and I think it''s a bit over saturated I still really like this photo!</td>', 'Even though I can see your reflection and I think it''s a bit over saturated I still really like this photo!', '2007-09-07 17:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069765, 580683, 66784, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! The best capture of a Raptor I''ve seen.</td>', 'Fantastic! The best capture of a Raptor I''ve seen.', '2007-09-07 17:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069855, 582193, 74534, '<td valign="top">Interesting... I tend not to agree with the interpretation of "power" as "strength / resistance" but I do have to say this is original approach. Very good juxtaposition of opposites... Extra points for originality. However, other than the concept, this photo does not have much going for it.</td>', 'Interesting... I tend not to agree with the interpretation of "power" as "strength / resistance" but I do have to say this is original approach. Very good juxtaposition of opposites... Extra points for originality. However, other than the concept, this photo does not have much going for it.', '2007-09-07 17:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069860, 580277, 74534, '<td valign="top">Does not evoke power to me, more grace and agility. Another airplane pic I just voted on spoke of "power" more, I know there''s nothing you can do about that but couldn''t help but compare... Good choice of moment though.</td>', 'Does not evoke power to me, more grace and agility. Another airplane pic I just voted on spoke of "power" more, I know there''s nothing you can do about that but couldn''t help but compare... Good choice of moment though.', '2007-09-07 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069869, 579145, 74534, '<td valign="top">Original concept, extra points for that. Unfortunately, kind of flat and unconvincing technically, both composition wise and lighting wise. Maybe a blanket over the battery? :) Cardboard in the back is very boring.</td>', 'Original concept, extra points for that. Unfortunately, kind of flat and unconvincing technically, both composition wise and lighting wise. Maybe a blanket over the battery? :) Cardboard in the back is very boring.', '2007-09-07 17:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069873, 580659, 74534, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this a DNMC for me, points subtracted for that. Photo wise, EXCELLENT lighting on the face. Since the background is rather boring, I would suggest a much tighter crop, maybe go for portrait orientation. I assume the negative space appealed to you, but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Sorry, this a DNMC for me, points subtracted for that. Photo wise, EXCELLENT lighting on the face. Since the background is rather boring, I would suggest a much tighter crop, maybe go for portrait orientation. I assume the negative space appealed to you, but it doesn''t work for me.', '2007-09-07 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069879, 581705, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very subtle expression of power... As far as the water goes, you have to wait a some years before its power over the rocks becomes apparent. The dark sky appears to hold more power at this very instant.<br/> <br/>Good choice of shutter speed on the waves, nice colors, and good processing. Would have wished to see a bit more in the field of view. Medium score from me, as I feel it does not fully express the challenge.</td>', 'Very subtle expression of power... As far as the water goes, you have to wait a some years before its power over the rocks becomes apparent. The dark sky appears to hold more power at this very instant. Good choice of shutter speed on the waves, nice colors, and good processing. Would have wished to see a bit more in the field of view. Medium score from me, as I feel it does not fully express the challenge.', '2007-09-07 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069884, 582272, 74534, '<td valign="top">I feel the sunset in the sky is more the subject of this pic than the power lines... That said, tremendous colors and processing. I sort of wish you had found some more interesting silhouettes to contrast with the sky and than put this into another challenge, or maybe a free study.</td>', 'I feel the sunset in the sky is more the subject of this pic than the power lines... That said, tremendous colors and processing. I sort of wish you had found some more interesting silhouettes to contrast with the sky and than put this into another challenge, or maybe a free study.', '2007-09-07 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069890, 581678, 74534, '<td valign="top">Sorry, DNMC from me. Without the title, "power" is maybe the third or fourth feeling this image evokes. Better processing could have made the colors and contrast pop, and solved a slight underexposure problem as well. Good eye to capture the moment though.</td>', 'Sorry, DNMC from me. Without the title, "power" is maybe the third or fourth feeling this image evokes. Better processing could have made the colors and contrast pop, and solved a slight underexposure problem as well. Good eye to capture the moment though.', '2007-09-07 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069997, 582501, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good lighting, focus and composition.</td>', 'Nice image, good lighting, focus and composition.', '2007-09-07 18:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070006, 579153, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great capture !!</td>', 'Great capture !!', '2007-09-07 18:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070038, 580507, 63503, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture, definetely conveying power. I am not sure of the reason to show this in B&amp;W, unless the biker and bike are predominantly black, I still would like to see it in full color. Also, using a fill flash may have improved the image further, assuming that you were using a wide angle lens and that you were not too far from the subject (8)</td>', 'Incredible capture, definetely conveying power. I am not sure of the reason to show this in B&W, unless the biker and bike are predominantly black, I still would like to see it in full color. Also, using a fill flash may have improved the image further, assuming that you were using a wide angle lens and that you were not too far from the subject (8)', '2007-09-07 18:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070065, 579615, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image, unfortunately a bit too much noise. Did you try using noise ninja or neatimage?</td>', 'Very pretty image, unfortunately a bit too much noise. Did you try using noise ninja or neatimage?', '2007-09-07 18:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070103, 582240, 63269, '<td valign="top">I would suggest adjusting the levels on this image - the black shades are more of a washed-out gray. Neat shot though!</td>', 'I would suggest adjusting the levels on this image - the black shades are more of a washed-out gray. Neat shot though!', '2007-09-07 19:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070105, 582341, 63503, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture, however, I am not sure it conveys a feeling of power but rather the opposite; it appears to be a calm and slowly flowing stream, undoubtely as a result of the long exposure time and perhaps overuse of neatimage or noiseninja? I''ll give it a 6, but would have given it a 8 or 9 if it had better met the challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture, however, I am not sure it conveys a feeling of power but rather the opposite; it appears to be a calm and slowly flowing stream, undoubtely as a result of the long exposure time and perhaps overuse of neatimage or noiseninja? I''ll give it a 6, but would have given it a 8 or 9 if it had better met the challenge.', '2007-09-07 19:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070110, 582149, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, great panning. Absolute power !! (10)</td>', 'Beautiful picture, great panning. Absolute power !! (10)', '2007-09-07 19:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070123, 580188, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I really like the color tones.</td>', 'Interesting - I really like the color tones.', '2007-09-07 19:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070132, 581802, 63269, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is a perfect photograph - the focus and exposure are fine. But it''s not a very interesting image, and doesn''t really potray a feeling of power. It''s still a nice image, good try! :)</td>', 'Technically, this is a perfect photograph - the focus and exposure are fine. But it''s not a very interesting image, and doesn''t really potray a feeling of power. It''s still a nice image, good try! :)', '2007-09-07 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070136, 581185, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very interesting - I love all the textures and the simplicity of the three colors.</td>', 'Very interesting - I love all the textures and the simplicity of the three colors.', '2007-09-07 19:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070141, 580893, 63269, '<td valign="top">Superb. Something quality about this image really intrigues me, but I''m not sure what it is... maybe something about the lighting and the tones. Neat shot!</td>', 'Superb. Something quality about this image really intrigues me, but I''m not sure what it is... maybe something about the lighting and the tones. Neat shot!', '2007-09-07 19:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070144, 581202, 63269, '<td valign="top">Splendid! The awesome point of view and the perfect composition does potraty lots of power. The image does look slightly underexposed though, perhaps either some adjustments in levels or adding some contrast might help. Otherwise, very nice shot!</td>', 'Splendid! The awesome point of view and the perfect composition does potraty lots of power. The image does look slightly underexposed though, perhaps either some adjustments in levels or adding some contrast might help. Otherwise, very nice shot!', '2007-09-07 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070158, 582057, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks out of focus... although I can understand that this would probably be a difficult subjet to photograph! Getting the focus right with brightly lit objects can be tough. Also next time, you might want to try and create a more interesting composition, or even shoot the subject from a slightly different angle. Good try though!</td>', 'This looks out of focus... although I can understand that this would probably be a difficult subjet to photograph! Getting the focus right with brightly lit objects can be tough. Also next time, you might want to try and create a more interesting composition, or even shoot the subject from a slightly different angle. Good try though!', '2007-09-07 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070163, 582297, 63269, '<td valign="top">Everything in this image is just splendid. :) Very nice!</td>', 'Everything in this image is just splendid. :) Very nice!', '2007-09-07 19:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070175, 581866, 36462, '<td valign="top">awesome! 8</td>', 'awesome! 8', '2007-09-07 19:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
