(4070208, 579966, 36462, '<td valign="top">I love images of incoming/outgoing storms....the colors seem a bit washed out, i dunno tho, maybe you intended it to be darker?  Reminds me kind of "The Dark Crystal" or something.</td>', 'I love images of incoming/outgoing storms....the colors seem a bit washed out, i dunno tho, maybe you intended it to be darker?  Reminds me kind of "The Dark Crystal" or something.', '2007-09-07 19:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
