(4070231, 582459, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is really neat! I love the high-contrast on the flowers, and the bright cheery texture they create in the foreground of the image.</td>', 'This is really neat! I love the high-contrast on the flowers, and the bright cheery texture they create in the foreground of the image.', '2007-09-07 19:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070238, 579426, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting... and neat use of minimalism. It''s difficult to really make out what this is, however. It would be really nice if there had been some way to isolate your subject - the trees in the background are distracting. Also, I''m not entirely sure how this fits the challenge. But the sunray pointing to the subject is really neat! Good try! :)</td>', 'Interesting... and neat use of minimalism. It''s difficult to really make out what this is, however. It would be really nice if there had been some way to isolate your subject - the trees in the background are distracting. Also, I''m not entirely sure how this fits the challenge. But the sunray pointing to the subject is really neat! Good try! :)', '2007-09-07 19:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070241, 580432, 63269, '<td valign="top">Completely awesome. This is totally beautiful with the harmony of light, textures, and color. I love it. :)</td>', 'Completely awesome. This is totally beautiful with the harmony of light, textures, and color. I love it. :)', '2007-09-07 19:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070243, 581705, 63269, '<td valign="top">Glorious. One of the top ten for sure! :)</td>', 'Glorious. One of the top ten for sure! :)', '2007-09-07 19:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070260, 582466, 63269, '<td valign="top">Here''s my two cents. :)<br/> <br/>First of all, the image is sort of blurry. If that were fixed, that would majorly help this image. Also, there is a sort of blueish tint to the photo - perhaps the lighting was wierd. I would suggest either trying some adjustments with selective color in photo-shop, or maybe even trying out black and white. Last, the composition is sort of cluttered. The sign in the lower left corner is very distracting! If there had been anyway to get rid of that, and the sign in the background that would help out. Perhaps lifting the camera above the sign might have worked. <br/> <br/>Hope this was helpful! :)</td>', 'Here''s my two cents. :) First of all, the image is sort of blurry. If that were fixed, that would majorly help this image. Also, there is a sort of blueish tint to the photo - perhaps the lighting was wierd. I would suggest either trying some adjustments with selective color in photo-shop, or maybe even trying out black and white. Last, the composition is sort of cluttered. The sign in the lower left corner is very distracting! If there had been anyway to get rid of that, and the sign in the background that would help out. Perhaps lifting the camera above the sign might have worked.  Hope this was helpful! :)', '2007-09-07 19:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070267, 580507, 63269, '<td valign="top">Splendid photo - the focus and lighting are perfect. I also like the black and white.</td>', 'Splendid photo - the focus and lighting are perfect. I also like the black and white.', '2007-09-07 19:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070274, 580848, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, I can see where you were going with this, but I personally really don''t like the harsh lighting. Perhaps if you had cropped out the sun and played around with the contrast... sorry! Interesting POV and composition though! :)</td>', 'Well, I can see where you were going with this, but I personally really don''t like the harsh lighting. Perhaps if you had cropped out the sun and played around with the contrast... sorry! Interesting POV and composition though! :)', '2007-09-07 19:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070284, 581928, 63269, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably intense. The moment I laid eyes on this I was stunned. The textures created by the buildings and the millions of lights is just awesome. I also love the black and gold colors...which makes me almost whish the greenish building in the lower left was not there. But that''s just my opinion. Absoulutley <i>beautiful </i>image!</td>', 'Unbelievably intense. The moment I laid eyes on this I was stunned. The textures created by the buildings and the millions of lights is just awesome. I also love the black and gold colors...which makes me almost whish the greenish building in the lower left was not there. But that''s just my opinion. Absoulutley beautiful image!', '2007-09-07 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070290, 582256, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, the lighting looks a little washed out on the bottom few books, and the image would probably be nicer if that could have been fixed. However, I think this is a very nice image, and I like your take on the challenge. The colors are lovely!</td>', 'Well, the lighting looks a little washed out on the bottom few books, and the image would probably be nicer if that could have been fixed. However, I think this is a very nice image, and I like your take on the challenge. The colors are lovely!', '2007-09-07 20:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070296, 582040, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I would suggest adding slightly more contrast, and also, if there had been any way to clear the clutter out of the photo, that might have made the composition nicer. Good try thouh!</td>', 'Very nice! I would suggest adding slightly more contrast, and also, if there had been any way to clear the clutter out of the photo, that might have made the composition nicer. Good try thouh!', '2007-09-07 20:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070307, 580729, 83906, '<td valign="top">I feel the focus on the planes could be sharper and also if there were some kind of background, like clouds. I don''t think this one works so well in black and white.</td>', 'I feel the focus on the planes could be sharper and also if there were some kind of background, like clouds. I don''t think this one works so well in black and white.', '2007-09-07 20:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070308, 579755, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this image is absolutely superb. However, I can''t really make out what the light is coming from. Also... maybe I''m getting picky here, but all the various braclets on the arms give the image a slightly cluttered feel... and well, I really, really love the bright lighting and the pure white everywhere. It gives everything such a clear, bright feeling. I think that feeling might have been enhanced without the bracelets, and perhaps with a more identifyable light source... But otherwise this is just a lovely image! Very beautiful, a seven from me! :)</td>', 'The lighting on this image is absolutely superb. However, I can''t really make out what the light is coming from. Also... maybe I''m getting picky here, but all the various braclets on the arms give the image a slightly cluttered feel... and well, I really, really love the bright lighting and the pure white everywhere. It gives everything such a clear, bright feeling. I think that feeling might have been enhanced without the bracelets, and perhaps with a more identifyable light source... But otherwise this is just a lovely image! Very beautiful, a seven from me! :)', '2007-09-07 20:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070310, 578827, 83906, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite feel a sense of power from this. I feel it''s more about daily toil and work than power.</td>', 'I don''t quite feel a sense of power from this. I feel it''s more about daily toil and work than power.', '2007-09-07 20:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070311, 581260, 83906, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but I think it would be better if it were from a different angle and a little sharper.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but I think it would be better if it were from a different angle and a little sharper.', '2007-09-07 20:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070313, 580556, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. I love the color and the angle. I feel like it could be a bit sharper, but other than that it''s pretty great.</td>', 'I like this alot. I love the color and the angle. I feel like it could be a bit sharper, but other than that it''s pretty great.', '2007-09-07 20:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070318, 581167, 83906, '<td valign="top">It''s a good, pretty shot, but I don''t feel like there''s anything else special about it.</td>', 'It''s a good, pretty shot, but I don''t feel like there''s anything else special about it.', '2007-09-07 20:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070321, 582387, 63269, '<td valign="top">I have no clue how you did this (unless the background is a painted wall with a power plug in it?) :) It might have been nicer if the grass had been better exposed...but it made me laugh! I love this! Very, <i>very </i>clever!</td>', 'I have no clue how you did this (unless the background is a painted wall with a power plug in it?) :) It might have been nicer if the grass had been better exposed...but it made me laugh! I love this! Very, very clever!', '2007-09-07 20:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070325, 580865, 83906, '<td valign="top">I really like this take on the theme. It shows more creative thinking than some of the others. I don''t know how I feel about the actual photography, but I really like the approach.</td>', 'I really like this take on the theme. It shows more creative thinking than some of the others. I don''t know how I feel about the actual photography, but I really like the approach.', '2007-09-07 20:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070329, 582335, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice - it''s difficult to photograph a toy or model like this and make it look realistic, but this is pretty good. It looks slightly out of focus, and some more contrast would have been nice. But otherwise well done.</td>', 'Nice - it''s difficult to photograph a toy or model like this and make it look realistic, but this is pretty good. It looks slightly out of focus, and some more contrast would have been nice. But otherwise well done.', '2007-09-07 20:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
