(4070336, 582019, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. I feel like it really fits the theme. It''s kind of like a David and Goliath type of image. It''s a really great shot. A great moment. Great focus</td>', 'I like this alot. I feel like it really fits the theme. It''s kind of like a David and Goliath type of image. It''s a really great shot. A great moment. Great focus', '2007-09-07 20:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070340, 581869, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the theme, but I''m not so crazy about the image. I feel like it doesn''t quite convey power. I think it would be much more effective if it were cropped to just include the bunch of rocks at the far right.</td>', 'I like this take on the theme, but I''m not so crazy about the image. I feel like it doesn''t quite convey power. I think it would be much more effective if it were cropped to just include the bunch of rocks at the far right.', '2007-09-07 20:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070345, 581866, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like the image. It''s a great shot, but I don''t feel like it strongly represents the theme. I think it might be better if it were more of the stars or just the stars. I feel like the lights below take away from the stars.</td>', 'I like the image. It''s a great shot, but I don''t feel like it strongly represents the theme. I think it might be better if it were more of the stars or just the stars. I feel like the lights below take away from the stars.', '2007-09-07 20:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070348, 579615, 83906, '<td valign="top">It''s nice and it''s pretty, but I feel like it isn''t that interesting. I don''t feel particularly moved and I don''t feel like it''s all that exceptional.</td>', 'It''s nice and it''s pretty, but I feel like it isn''t that interesting. I don''t feel particularly moved and I don''t feel like it''s all that exceptional.', '2007-09-07 20:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070354, 581854, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like this one because I feel like it does fit the theme. It''s a great take on the theme. I feel it would be slightly stronger if it were taken with a faster shutterspeed to more effectivly freeze the motion, but the angle is great because it''s like this great beast bursting forth.</td>', 'I like this one because I feel like it does fit the theme. It''s a great take on the theme. I feel it would be slightly stronger if it were taken with a faster shutterspeed to more effectivly freeze the motion, but the angle is great because it''s like this great beast bursting forth.', '2007-09-07 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070357, 582193, 83906, '<td valign="top">I wish I could better understand your take on this. I understand that there''s a comparison between electrical power and fragile power. I like the idea, but I feel like it could be better depicted.</td>', 'I wish I could better understand your take on this. I understand that there''s a comparison between electrical power and fragile power. I like the idea, but I feel like it could be better depicted.', '2007-09-07 20:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070363, 580011, 83906, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Fantastic lighting that casts great shadows on his body. I feel the tattoo on his arm makes this a more effective image and his expression also adds to it.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Fantastic lighting that casts great shadows on his body. I feel the tattoo on his arm makes this a more effective image and his expression also adds to it.', '2007-09-07 20:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070367, 581474, 83906, '<td valign="top">I would imagine that the idea is the power behind prayer. I really like that idea, but I feel like the image could use some improvements, such as adding contrast. It feels like the image is kind of hazy and I think bumping up the contrast would make the image look a little sharper. Also, if you took a step to the left and got a few pews in the shot. More pews and more contrast could make this image really strong.</td>', 'I would imagine that the idea is the power behind prayer. I really like that idea, but I feel like the image could use some improvements, such as adding contrast. It feels like the image is kind of hazy and I think bumping up the contrast would make the image look a little sharper. Also, if you took a step to the left and got a few pews in the shot. More pews and more contrast could make this image really strong.', '2007-09-07 20:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070373, 582207, 83906, '<td valign="top">I would imagine that the title is referring to the towing power of the boat, but this image I don''t feel really reflects that. Or is it supposed to be that the boat is pulling the sun? Or vice versa? I don''t quite understand how it fits the theme. Without the title, I would think it was just a photo of a pretty sunset. If there were a stronger connection to the sun and the boat, if there is supposed to be one, such as a different angle where it showed the boat closed to the sun, then I believe the image would be much stronger.</td>', 'I would imagine that the title is referring to the towing power of the boat, but this image I don''t feel really reflects that. Or is it supposed to be that the boat is pulling the sun? Or vice versa? I don''t quite understand how it fits the theme. Without the title, I would think it was just a photo of a pretty sunset. If there were a stronger connection to the sun and the boat, if there is supposed to be one, such as a different angle where it showed the boat closed to the sun, then I believe the image would be much stronger.', '2007-09-07 20:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070378, 581894, 83906, '<td valign="top">I. love. this. I think this is my favorite so far. I love the approach to this. There''s great contrast. I think people forget that there''s such power in destruction.</td>', 'I. love. this. I think this is my favorite so far. I love the approach to this. There''s great contrast. I think people forget that there''s such power in destruction.', '2007-09-07 20:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070385, 581849, 83906, '<td valign="top">I really like this image because of the simplicity, the colors, the shape, the rhythm of the round shapes, but I don''t feel like it conveys power. If the lights were brighter or if the angle were more straight on. It''s a great image, but I don''t really feel it fits the theme. Also, the stars or whatever that is in the upper third in the image really detracts from the lights.</td>', 'I really like this image because of the simplicity, the colors, the shape, the rhythm of the round shapes, but I don''t feel like it conveys power. If the lights were brighter or if the angle were more straight on. It''s a great image, but I don''t really feel it fits the theme. Also, the stars or whatever that is in the upper third in the image really detracts from the lights.', '2007-09-07 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070392, 579943, 83906, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I think alot of it comes from the title because without that, I wouldn''t quite understand how it fits the theme. The lightning is fantastic. There''s a great tonal range and great contrast. I really like the symmetry and his intense expression. Great job.</td>', 'This is a great image. I think alot of it comes from the title because without that, I wouldn''t quite understand how it fits the theme. The lightning is fantastic. There''s a great tonal range and great contrast. I really like the symmetry and his intense expression. Great job.', '2007-09-07 20:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070399, 582552, 83906, '<td valign="top">I can understand that it''s supposed to be about the power of the truck, the power of the engine, but I feel like the image isn''t that strong. If it somehow included the engine or some part of the truck''s parts, I feel it would be much stronger. I like the approach, but I feel like the image doesn''t effectively communicate what I think you''re trying to.</td>', 'I can understand that it''s supposed to be about the power of the truck, the power of the engine, but I feel like the image isn''t that strong. If it somehow included the engine or some part of the truck''s parts, I feel it would be much stronger. I like the approach, but I feel like the image doesn''t effectively communicate what I think you''re trying to.', '2007-09-07 20:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070404, 582004, 83906, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I think it''s a great approach to the theme. The only thing is that, given the title, I think it would be much stronger if there was a close up on the face of the tiger.</td>', 'This is a great image. I think it''s a great approach to the theme. The only thing is that, given the title, I think it would be much stronger if there was a close up on the face of the tiger.', '2007-09-07 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070417, 582335, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think it would be more effective if the car were in motion. Also, the fact that it''s a toy car bothers me. I like the connotation and all the ideas associated with the car.</td>', 'I like it, but I think it would be more effective if the car were in motion. Also, the fact that it''s a toy car bothers me. I like the connotation and all the ideas associated with the car.', '2007-09-07 20:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070428, 582291, 74406, '<td valign="top">no...  i can''t</td>', 'no...  i can''t', '2007-09-07 20:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070431, 581563, 83906, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea. It''s kind of a traditional take on the word, but it''s presented in such an unconventional way. I feel like there''s a bit too much going on, with the structure of the tower, the clouds and the trees. I think the trees and the clouds take away from the electricity idea.</td>', 'I really like the idea. It''s kind of a traditional take on the word, but it''s presented in such an unconventional way. I feel like there''s a bit too much going on, with the structure of the tower, the clouds and the trees. I think the trees and the clouds take away from the electricity idea.', '2007-09-07 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070498, 581107, 80878, '<td valign="top">creative! love it</td>', 'creative! love it', '2007-09-07 21:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070501, 582387, 80878, '<td valign="top">its a shame you can see the string holding up the socket! lol i wont hold it agains you seeing how its only basic editing</td>', 'its a shame you can see the string holding up the socket! lol i wont hold it agains you seeing how its only basic editing', '2007-09-07 21:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
