(4070729, 581107, 83906, '<td valign="top">I like it. I like the idea with using the orange because orange juice is supposed to be a great way to start off your day. Also, I like the power switch and the light. Great idea and great execution.</td>', 'I like it. I like the idea with using the orange because orange juice is supposed to be a great way to start off your day. Also, I like the power switch and the light. Great idea and great execution.', '2007-09-07 22:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070739, 582297, 83906, '<td valign="top">At first I would''ve said that I didn''t think this fit, but I think it does. I think what makes it work is all the lines going to the middle. It''s a great image and it''s really excellent composition.</td>', 'At first I would''ve said that I didn''t think this fit, but I think it does. I think what makes it work is all the lines going to the middle. It''s a great image and it''s really excellent composition.', '2007-09-07 22:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070746, 581522, 83906, '<td valign="top">I think this one is really neat. It''s a humourous take on the idea. I think it could''ve benefited from a greater depth of field, but otherwise it''s pretty good.</td>', 'I think this one is really neat. It''s a humourous take on the idea. I think it could''ve benefited from a greater depth of field, but otherwise it''s pretty good.', '2007-09-07 22:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070765, 581202, 83906, '<td valign="top">I think this one works because I feel like it''s about the power of the mind and how one can put mind over matter. How the world is so big and massive, but humans still have power. This one is really uplifting and motivational. It''s powerful on different levels.</td>', 'I think this one works because I feel like it''s about the power of the mind and how one can put mind over matter. How the world is so big and massive, but humans still have power. This one is really uplifting and motivational. It''s powerful on different levels.', '2007-09-07 22:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070776, 582290, 83906, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel like this one effectively communicates the theme. It feels very sad. I think it could be more effective if the child was looking up. It''s a beautiful image, but not appropriate for the theme.</td>', 'I don''t feel like this one effectively communicates the theme. It feels very sad. I think it could be more effective if the child was looking up. It''s a beautiful image, but not appropriate for the theme.', '2007-09-07 22:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
