(4078076, 582207, 63269, '<td valign="top">Exquisite, interesting colors! And bravo on the composition, I really like it... it pulls my interest to both sides of the image, which I think somehow helps tie in the colors.</td>', 'Exquisite, interesting colors! And bravo on the composition, I really like it... it pulls my interest to both sides of the image, which I think somehow helps tie in the colors.', '2007-09-10 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078080, 582550, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although this doesn''t give very much impact or interest, it''s an excellent photo - the focus is very clear, and the colors nice. Good job. :)</td>', 'Although this doesn''t give very much impact or interest, it''s an excellent photo - the focus is very clear, and the colors nice. Good job. :)', '2007-09-10 13:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078089, 579947, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what I''m looking at here, and I''m even more confused as to how this fits the challenge... but the textures and colors are beautiful!  If there had been anyway to get rid of the (reflection?) of the camera, that would definitely help the image, and also, I would suggest cropping out the yellowish bar on top of the "jewel" things. They''re a little distracting. But good try! :)</td>', 'I''m not really sure what I''m looking at here, and I''m even more confused as to how this fits the challenge... but the textures and colors are beautiful!  If there had been anyway to get rid of the (reflection?) of the camera, that would definitely help the image, and also, I would suggest cropping out the yellowish bar on top of the "jewel" things. They''re a little distracting. But good try! :)', '2007-09-10 13:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078111, 579573, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, it isn''t very interesting... although I can understand it would be difficult to photograph this subject in such a way that it gives impact. Perhaps trying some different, unusual angles might have helped out? It is however, a nice clear shot, with good composition. :)</td>', 'Well, it isn''t very interesting... although I can understand it would be difficult to photograph this subject in such a way that it gives impact. Perhaps trying some different, unusual angles might have helped out? It is however, a nice clear shot, with good composition. :)', '2007-09-10 13:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078112, 581516, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I love the precision of your composition, and all the lines of architecture. I might suggest adding a little more contrast though, and perhaps even cropping out the heads of the people below, since they are a little distracting IMO. I also wonder how this would look in black and white...? but very nice shot! :)</td>', 'Very cool! I love the precision of your composition, and all the lines of architecture. I might suggest adding a little more contrast though, and perhaps even cropping out the heads of the people below, since they are a little distracting IMO. I also wonder how this would look in black and white...? but very nice shot! :)', '2007-09-10 13:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078117, 581665, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although technically good - the focus is perfectly fine - this image doesn''t really give very much impact. Perhaps shooting from an even more dramatic angle might have created a more interesting shot? Good try though!</td>', 'Although technically good - the focus is perfectly fine - this image doesn''t really give very much impact. Perhaps shooting from an even more dramatic angle might have created a more interesting shot? Good try though!', '2007-09-10 13:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078123, 581932, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here, with the single light source. However, it creates some very strange shadows across the fist, so it''s hard to make out exactly what it is. Also, either the quality isn''t very good, or it might even be slightly out of focus... I can''t quite tell, but the details are not very strong. But very neat idea!</td>', 'I really like the idea here, with the single light source. However, it creates some very strange shadows across the fist, so it''s hard to make out exactly what it is. Also, either the quality isn''t very good, or it might even be slightly out of focus... I can''t quite tell, but the details are not very strong. But very neat idea!', '2007-09-10 13:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078127, 581020, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat picture, but it looks a little washed out - the clouds are slightly over-exposed. Perhaps if that could be fixed, the shot might have looked  better. But otherwise, neat idea! :)</td>', 'This is a very neat picture, but it looks a little washed out - the clouds are slightly over-exposed. Perhaps if that could be fixed, the shot might have looked  better. But otherwise, neat idea! :)', '2007-09-10 13:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078133, 582195, 63269, '<td valign="top">A neat capture! Some of the background elements are a little distracting - it would be nice if they weren''t there. Perhaps you weren''t in a situation where you were able to do that though. But I like the way this image portrays power - well done.</td>', 'A neat capture! Some of the background elements are a little distracting - it would be nice if they weren''t there. Perhaps you weren''t in a situation where you were able to do that though. But I like the way this image portrays power - well done.', '2007-09-10 13:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078136, 581630, 59194, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I''m going to guess this was shot from an airplane.  I like the tilted horizon.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I''m going to guess this was shot from an airplane.  I like the tilted horizon.', '2007-09-10 13:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078140, 582240, 59194, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I would have liked to see the darks a little darker.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I would have liked to see the darks a little darker.', '2007-09-10 13:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078149, 581136, 59194, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I bet a selective desat (keep the reds) would look pretty cool and help guide the eye away from the background.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I bet a selective desat (keep the reds) would look pretty cool and help guide the eye away from the background.', '2007-09-10 13:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078152, 581474, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/> <br/>My first impression of the image was that it was out of focus. It''s not <i>really</i>; but the arm of the closest pew is out of focus, and since it''s a large and dominates much of the shot, it kind of messed up my whole initial reaction of the photo. Either cropping that first pew arm out might have helped, or if possible, a less shallow depth of field would have fixed that while you actually taking the photo. <br/>Also, it looks really grainy! If it''s possible, I would suggest lowering the ISO on your camera. Getting rid of the grain will also make the photo appear in better focus. <br/>And last, the composition. It''s really kind of confusing. Instead of leading my eye to a particular point, my eye akwardly wanders all over the place. For this particular shot, I would suggest choosing a whole different angle for the shot. <br/>I hope this was helpful! :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :) My first impression of the image was that it was out of focus. It''s not really; but the arm of the closest pew is out of focus, and since it''s a large and dominates much of the shot, it kind of messed up my whole initial reaction of the photo. Either cropping that first pew arm out might have helped, or if possible, a less shallow depth of field would have fixed that while you actually taking the photo. Also, it looks really grainy! If it''s possible, I would suggest lowering the ISO on your camera. Getting rid of the grain will also make the photo appear in better focus. And last, the composition. It''s really kind of confusing. Instead of leading my eye to a particular point, my eye akwardly wanders all over the place. For this particular shot, I would suggest choosing a whole different angle for the shot. I hope this was helpful! :)', '2007-09-10 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078161, 581854, 59194, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  I like the top/tight crop and the expression on his face.</td>', 'Great action shot.  I like the top/tight crop and the expression on his face.', '2007-09-10 13:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
