(4084544, 581854, 59166, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by z1fan:</b></div><hr/><i> A bit too thight a crop imo, and lacks some essential sharpness to make it nr1 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t crop it as I was taking a series of him coming through the mud and this was the lat one as I was trying to get out of the way. I just liked it the best and thought this one showed "power" better than the others in the series. I also wish I could''ve used a faster speed but it was in the trees and quite shady so that''s all I could really do. Thanks for all the great comments and I''m thrilled with my first time 17th pl finish!!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by z1fan: A bit too thight a crop imo, and lacks some essential sharpness to make it nr1   I didn''t crop it as I was taking a series of him coming through the mud and this was the lat one as I was trying to get out of the way. I just liked it the best and thought this one showed "power" better than the others in the series. I also wish I could''ve used a faster speed but it was in the trees and quite shady so that''s all I could really do. Thanks for all the great comments and I''m thrilled with my first time 17th pl finish!!!!', '2007-09-12 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
