(4088000, 582516, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HighNooner:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave it a 4, but looking back at it now; maybe a 3 or a 2 would have been more appropriate.<br/> <br/>When you make a entry you promote an idea with it. Some people here, I included, do not like violence and we vote accordingly.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80096" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">digifotojo</a> you have my support </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What is the idea he was promoting? Violence? If that''s so then every newspaper, every tv news station that has ever shown a photo of say war torn Iraq is promoting violence and the war. I guess we should all censor it and live in ignorant bliss. Context dictates intent and I don''t think you are factoring in the context in which this shot was entered at all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-13 17:37:15.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by HighNooner: I gave it a 4, but looking back at it now; maybe a 3 or a 2 would have been more appropriate. When you make a entry you promote an idea with it. Some people here, I included, do not like violence and we vote accordingly.  digifotojo you have my support   What is the idea he was promoting? Violence? If that''s so then every newspaper, every tv news station that has ever shown a photo of say war torn Iraq is promoting violence and the war. I guess we should all censor it and live in ignorant bliss. Context dictates intent and I don''t think you are factoring in the context in which this shot was entered at all.', '2007-09-13 18:35:24.000000', '2007-09-13 18:37:15.000000', 0),
