(4094282, 581517, 61651, '<td valign="top">It''s funny to say this but it actually makes me a bit seasick to look at it - not saying that''s a bad thing, by the way.  All by way of saying that I like how the sloping line of trees and further slope of the mountain run counter to each other and introduce a nice energy to what would ordinarily be a static landscape shot.  Fantastic as b&amp;w.</td>', 'It''s funny to say this but it actually makes me a bit seasick to look at it - not saying that''s a bad thing, by the way.  All by way of saying that I like how the sloping line of trees and further slope of the mountain run counter to each other and introduce a nice energy to what would ordinarily be a static landscape shot.  Fantastic as b&w.', '2007-09-16 18:00:22.000000', NULL, 0),
