(4378444, 581464, 37719, '<td valign="top">I chose this as a favorite a few months ago but never commented.  After reading your details, I would have to say that the light-post was one of the elements that intrigued me with this shot.  It certainly made the title/picture connection, but more than that if you think of the ethereal or esoteric.  I actually find the trees more of a distraction if there has to be one, but for me, the element they represent in the shot is balance.  Love the cloud formation/thunderhead and the color balance across the scene - not to be religious (especially since I am very non religious) but what immediately came to mind was "on Earth as it is in Heaven."  Nice shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-09 16:09:57.</i></td>', 'I chose this as a favorite a few months ago but never commented.  After reading your details, I would have to say that the light-post was one of the elements that intrigued me with this shot.  It certainly made the title/picture connection, but more than that if you think of the ethereal or esoteric.  I actually find the trees more of a distraction if there has to be one, but for me, the element they represent in the shot is balance.  Love the cloud formation/thunderhead and the color balance across the scene - not to be religious (especially since I am very non religious) but what immediately came to mind was "on Earth as it is in Heaven."  Nice shot!', '2008-01-09 16:07:51.000000', '2008-01-09 16:09:57.000000', 0),
(4405388, 582433, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too bad you utterly failed to meet your prediction.  I expect better out of you, Mr. Priest!  Next time you shoot for a middling score, I expect you to hit it.</td>', 'Too bad you utterly failed to meet your prediction.  I expect better out of you, Mr. Priest!  Next time you shoot for a middling score, I expect you to hit it.', '2008-01-19 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
