(6225020, 582207, 49166, '<td valign="top">Wow, been a while since I been here. I see my post processing skills were Really bad back then......anyway, the photo itself:Focus on the boat with the smoke going seemingly in the wrong direction (leading the boat). Now look perpindicular down to the water. Behind the "pulling power" boat is the 200''+ trawl thats being pulled. However, the "leading" smoke is another trawl boat directly behind the puller taking away from the perspective I was trying to convey. I just found the original and the colors are exactly correct - off the coast of Grand Isle that early morning.......<br/>Anyway I hope to find the time to get back on here.....Thx</td>', 'Wow, been a while since I been here. I see my post processing skills were Really bad back then......anyway, the photo itself:Focus on the boat with the smoke going seemingly in the wrong direction (leading the boat). Now look perpindicular down to the water. Behind the "pulling power" boat is the 200''+ trawl thats being pulled. However, the "leading" smoke is another trawl boat directly behind the puller taking away from the perspective I was trying to convey. I just found the original and the colors are exactly correct - off the coast of Grand Isle that early morning.......Anyway I hope to find the time to get back on here.....Thx', '2010-11-16 22:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
